<span class=3D"cursor-pointer">What is the Canvas?</span></h2>
<span data-as=3D"p">The Canvas is a space to explore and iterate on designs=
 with Agent. Here, you=E2=80=99ll see your artifacts =E2=80=94 such as apps=
, videos, and slides =E2=80=94 displayed in a frame. You can work with Agen=
